cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use wongo in your research, please cite it using this metadata."
title: wongo (원고)
abstract: >-
  A Python package and CLI for a verified Quarto-to-journal manuscript
  pipeline: machine-readable journal profiles with source-traced,
  staleness-audited requirements; submission-grade DOCX rendering with
  OOXML correctness fixes and data-driven house styles; and tracked-changes
  round-tripping that keeps Word-native coauthors in the loop while the
  .qmd stays the single source of truth.
authors:
